#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:5
#: 865cab987ccc4b219b860b1de6d313aa
msgid "RC Transmitter Flight Mode Configuration"
msgstr "遥控发射机飞行模式配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:7
#: b4a4100d54c84a059a5e435d3cd2ed23
msgid ""
"This article shows how you can enable up to 6 autopilot control/flight "
"modes to be set from your RC transmitter via the flight mode channel "
"(:ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>` for plane/copter/sub, "
":ref:`MODE_CH<MODE_CH>` for rover). Flight mode changes can also be made "
"via RC channels setup as :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions`."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何通过飞行模式通道（Plane/Copter/Sub 使用 :ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>`，Rover 使用"
" :ref:`MODE_CH<MODE_CH>`）从遥控发射机设置最多 6 个飞控/飞行模式。飞行模式更改也可通过设置为 :ref"
":`common-auxiliary-functions` 的 RC 通道进行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:12
#: 4a2fda235fcd4232b244e930b7dad8b3
msgid "Flight modes configuration"
msgstr "飞行模式配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:28
#: 49b0fc2a12164b4a91599c8c470b6a07
msgid "Setting the flight mode channel"
msgstr "设置飞行模式通道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:30
#: 2138e8170f4d477eb5108e7dbda231a6
msgid ""
"The flight mode channel is the input radio channel that ArduPilot "
"monitors for mode changes."
msgstr "飞行模式通道是 ArduPilot 监测模式切换的 RC 输入通道。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:38
#: 0dbfcb5a5ba24117a8ae45ea0f48eebc
msgid "Transmitter configuration"
msgstr "发射机配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:40
#: 208cd25592e841d68a3c789c93ee1f01
msgid ""
"The transmitter must emit PWM signals in the correct range to allow us to"
" map a mode to a switch position."
msgstr "发射机必须在正确范围内输出 PWM 信号，以便将模式映射至开关位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst
#: 6a2a529553d9450b8cba399b474c6645
msgid "Generally the range is between 1000 to 2000 us (1.0 to 2.0 ms)."
msgstr "通常范围为 1000 至 2000 us（1.0 至 2.0 ms）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst
#: 938324bd69f84b1bbee3e2f8f579c766
msgid "ms = millisecond"
msgstr "ms = 毫秒"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst
#: 66f976fbfe5346758607a4ef84c879ee
msgid "us = microsecond"
msgstr "us = 微秒"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:48
#: 499e7e523ca741e29aaba29c3f87e80f
msgid ""
"The correct PWM ranges for selectable modes are shown alongside each mode"
" selection dropdown in the *Mission Planner Flight Mode* screen (see "
":ref:`screenshot above <common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-"
"configuration_flight_modes_configuration>`)."
msgstr ""
"可选模式对应的正确 PWM 范围在 *Mission Planner 飞行模式* 界面每个模式选择下拉菜单旁显示（见 :ref:`上方截图 "
"<common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-"
"configuration_flight_modes_configuration>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:52
#: 4a3ae447c5544e658794e47827003bd4
msgid ""
"If you want to just support three modes (using a three position switch) "
"then you would configure the transmitter to produce PWM pulse widths of "
"1165, 1425, and 1815 us for the respective switch positions."
msgstr "若只需支持三个模式（使用三档开关），则需将发射机配置为分别输出 1165、1425 和 1815 us 的 PWM 脉宽。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:56
#: 426e384a5c54472d83da487e67b5c910
msgid ""
"If you want to support 6 modes then the transmitter will need to emit PWM"
" widths of around 1165, 1295, 1425, 1555, 1685, and 1815 us. Typically "
"this is achieved by configuring the transmitter to mix a two position "
"switch and a three position switch (giving 6 modes in total). You can "
"also do this with an analog dial if one is available, but it’s hard to "
"reliably turn a dial to just the right position for six distinct "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"若需支持 6 个模式，发射机则需输出约 1165、1295、1425、1555、1685 和 1815 us 的 PWM "
"宽度。通常通过将两档开关和三档开关混控来实现（共 6 个模式）。也可使用模拟旋钮（如果有），但很难可靠地将旋钮精确转到六个不同位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:64
#: 847a2fbd13524730bfb7d14d6eedc182
msgid ""
"The sections below provide links showing how to configure transmitters "
"from different manufactures, and how to test (in Mission Planner) that "
"each switch setting is emitting the appropriate PWM signal."
msgstr "以下章节提供了各厂商发射机的配置说明链接，以及如何在 Mission Planner 中测试每个开关位置是否输出正确的 PWM 信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:69
#: 8f1c5d3d7fd948adb63adfc31ebafd4f
msgid "Test transmitter switch settings"
msgstr "测试发射机开关设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:71
#: 009ddde1cdf743608bb87cb98c123c0b
msgid ""
"You can use the *Mission Planner Radio Calibration* screen to test the "
"PWM pulse widths for each mode setting."
msgstr "您可以使用 *Mission Planner 遥控校准* 界面测试每个模式设置对应的 PWM 脉宽。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:74
#: b5bc3751291546d8b591f0350f18e705
msgid ""
"Simply toggle through the modes on your transmitter and confirm that the "
"PWM for the selected channel matches the required PWM values. The "
"screenshot below assumes that the flight mode channel is set to Radio 5."
msgstr "只需在发射机上依次切换各模式，并确认所选通道的 PWM 值与所需值匹配。以下截图假设飞行模式通道设置为 Radio 5。"

